  "identifier": "haste-health",
  "name": "Haste Health",
  "description": "Open-source FHIR R4 server written in Rust, aimed at AI-native health applications. Stores clinical data as FHIR and serves it to apps, analytics, and AI agents through one API, with OAuth2, SMART-on-FHIR, and an MCP server built in. Ingests from Epic, Oracle Health, and HL7v2; outputs FHIR, SQL-on-FHIR, and MCP. Apache-2.0 licensed and self-hostable (docker-compose, an npm package, or native Linux/macOS binaries), with a hosted option under a signed BAA.",
  "url": "https://haste.health",
  "codeRepository": "https://github.com/HasteHealth/HasteHealth",
