  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-11-22",
  "schema:comment": "A newer entrant (surfaced via a Google AI Overview for 'self-hostable FHIR servers' that MACH had not yet catalogued). Rust + MCP-native positioning is distinctive among FHIR servers. Repo active with a large commit count; adoption still early (low star count) — the rule-based scorer will set its ring from harvested signals.",
